SUMMARY:Deadline: Vimeo Short Film Grant (USD 60\,000 for 5 filmmakers)
DESCRIPTION:Vimeo's Short Film Grant awards five emerging filmmakers USD 60
 \,000 in cash each to produce a short film\, alongside mentorship from cel
 ebrated filmmakers\, a loaned Panavision camera package\, OWC storage hard
 ware\, a one-year Vimeo Advanced subscription\, and distribution on Vimeo 
 with in-person screenings. ELIGIBILITY: residents of the United States or 
 Canada\, at least 18 years old\, who are emerging filmmakers having direct
 ed at least two short films but no feature films\; a valid Vimeo account i
 s required. TIMELINE: winners announced by 15 March 2027\; production must
  be completed by September 2027 and post-production by March 2028. HOW TO 
 APPLY: via SlideRoom with project details\, an artist statement\, team bio
 s\, creative materials (screenplay or treatment)\, a budget proposal\, a p
 roduction timeline and mentorship goals. No fee to apply. DEADLINE: 16 Oct
 ober 2026 at 11:59 PM ET (opened 21 September 2026).\n\nOrganisation: Vime
 o\nLocation: Online application. Open to residents of the United States an
 d Canada.\nAward: Five filmmakers each receive USD 60\,000 in cash for pro
 duction\, plus a one-year Vimeo Advanced subscription\, mentorship from ce
 lebrated filmmakers\, a loaned Panavision camera package\, OWC storage har
 dware\, and distribution on Vimeo with in-person screenings. Free to apply
 .\nDuration: Production must be completed by September 2027 and post-produ
 ction by March 2028\; winners announced by 15 March 2027\n\nMore: https://
 vimeo.com/shortfilmgrant?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=
 referral
URL:https://vimeo.com/shortfilmgrant?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&
 utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Online application. Open to residents of the United States and Can
 ada.
